Subject: [PATCH] drm: support Unicorn L2S display and runtime refresh

Implement the 1440x3200 DSC panel with 24/30/40/60/90/120 Hz modes,
60 Hz preferred, and a fixed 1.36 Gbit/s-per-lane transfer budget.
Preserve the OEM packet types, batching, TE scheduling and completion
waits. Serialize optional active mode and panel idle transactions with
power and brightness; both remain disabled by default. Generic VRR is
not advertised. Retain error reporting without bring-up register dumps,
BTA reads or diagnostic clock overrides.

Command data and timing source:
https://github.com/LineageOS/android_kernel_xiaomi_sm8450-devicetrees/blob/2e649a7f3e762903eedad43d8256b91e28b512d8/qcom/display/display/dsi-panel-l2s-38-0c-0a-dsc-cmd.dtsi

